descriptions.job-10rfsha:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT HUT 8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine the ultimate destination for those who want to work at the cutting edge of technology, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;energy,&lt;/span&gt; and infrastructure. Hut&amp;nbsp;8 is on a mission to build and operate some of the world’s largest data centers for next-generation computing workloads, including AI, Colocation, Cloud, and Bitcoin Mining. We are proud to offer interesting and challenging opportunities for individuals who want to build teams, solve problems, and make an impact from day one. If you’re an ambitious individual looking for a career that is as rewarding as it is challenging, you’ve come to the right place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Data Center Technician, you will work with state-of-the-art computing and networking &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;equipment to ensure optimal uptime and provide regular basic repair services. The ideal candidate &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;will be eager to learn about our network technologies and will demonstrate the ability to adapt to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;evolving systems. You should also be able to stay current with emerging technologies. An &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;analytical mindset is essential for troubleshooting and diagnosing issues with mining equipment, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;ensuring maximum uptime and minimizing turnaround times.&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;Data Center Technician&amp;nbsp;will perform routine maintenance under general supervision. This &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;position ensures that the facility remains available for use and is consistently maintained in a safe &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;and clean condition. The role involves operating various maintenance and mining tools and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;equipment, as well as performing other related tasks as directed by the Associate Manager and/or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Manager of Data Center Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1.15,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Some of the key responsibilities you should expect are the following:&lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559731&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562764&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335562765&amp;quot;:1.14999,&amp;quot;335562766&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562767&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335562768&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;335562769&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-scheme-color=&quot;@000000,13,&quot; data-usefontface=&quot;true&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Operations Management: &lt;/span&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
