&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QKmJdz5PKoUU4sxKssvlNFP7gte&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the product strategy and roadmap for both HR and Finance internal systems, driving end-to-end planning and execution across both product lines&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YNm3dFvE5oMEITx5xJllBZcBgng&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead and grow a cross-functional team, coordinating across HR, Finance, Engineering, Data Warehouse, and regional business stakeholders&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WnSzd8mWVoLeNWxfrwVlz4YLgi8&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the internal product owner for company employees as end users — proactively collect, triage, and act on feedback from internal users across regions to continuously improve the product experience&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NKuodLRqhoQWyFxVDfilzEzQg8g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive enterprise compliance capability building — data privacy, international regulatory compliance, internal audit enablement&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRpudN2E3oc5JhxSYWYlTsAFgt1&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
