&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-C4YPdBHhno66LcxmulglJo3hgkb&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OpgxdBi1qoKLszxfzBBlLDIWg5e&quot;&gt;You will own the technical direction of OKX&#39;s next-generation social feed recommendation system — evolving it from a content feed into a unified recommendation engine that surfaces both content and platform features. Your decisions directly shape the experience of tens of millions of users and drive platform trading conversion.&lt;/div&gt;
